e ballot."]}, "overview": "Minnesota's governorship is open after Tim Walz chose not to run, and Democrats have turned to Senator Amy Klobuchar, who faces Republican Lisa Demuth. Recent polls from SurveyUSA, KARE 11/Star Tribune, and others show Klobuchar ahead by seven to nine points, though a September survey from a Republican-leaning firm showed a two-point race. Independent averages put her lead near seven to eight points.\n\nKlobuchar has raised roughly $7 million to Demuth's $360,000, giving her a wide resource advantage. Rating outlets call the race Likely or Solid Democratic, and prediction markets price a Democratic win around 92 to 95 percent. The state's three-point Democratic lean and a minor Green Party candidate on the ballot round out the picture. A Republican upset would likely require a late shift in the national climate.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9683, "margin": 10.03}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9647, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.931, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9507, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9476, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9456, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9491, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9656, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9546, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9536, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9443, "margin": 8.8}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9456, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9461, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9453, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9445, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9397, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9598, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.927, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.949, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9409, "margin": 9.2}, {"date": "2026-1